            "type": "written",
            "text": "Myself with ten gentlemen and a hundred our followers will undertake the dispatch of the usurping competitor, from the obedience of whom, by the excommunication of the Pope, we are freed... Then will there be no difficulty, when she is taken away, in advancing the Queen of Scots to the crown, which belongs to her by hereditary right.",
            "content": "Myself with ten gentlemen and a hundred our followers will undertake the dispatch of the usurping competitor, from the obedience of whom, by the excommunication of the Pope, we are freed... Then will there be no difficulty, when she is taken away, in advancing the Queen of Scots to the crown, which belongs to her by hereditary right.",
