              "caption": "The official printed parliamentary statute of the 1601 Act for the Relief of the Poor (43 Elizabeth I c. 2), establishing compulsory parish poor rates, appointing Overseers of the Poor, providing raw materials to set the able-bodied to work, and funding almshouses for the impotent poor.",
              "desc": "Parliamentary statute of the 1601 Elizabethan Poor Relief Act.",
