            "tariff": "Q1(a): Feature [2 marks]",
            "text": "Q1(a). Describe one key feature of Walter Raleigh’s plans for colonising Virginia. [2 marks]",
            "model": "One key feature was that a royal license granting Raleigh the right to explore and colonise any lands not already possessed by Christian monarchs. Specifically, Raleigh was granted ownership of all land and minerals discovered, in exchange for giving the Crown one-fifth of all gold and silver mined."
